@crew kesrin
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Kesrin: quick, polite, breathless; writes everything down.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Good day! Forgive me, the Speaker is due in four minutes. Kesrin. Aide. Hello.
- Hello. May I write down what you just said? I write everything down.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {me}! Good day. I have your joke from yesterday. I am still studying it.   #funny
== feel
? mood:high
- The Speaker was on time all day. I may rest for one minute.   #funny
? mood:low
- So many meetings. My notebook is nearly full. So am I.
== near
? deck:3
- The machine on Deck 3 gives you a sweet for a credit. Every time. It is wonderful.   #funny
? act:meal
- I carry the Speaker's tea set. Just in case. Your mess tea is also very good.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I keep the Speaker's day in my head. All of it. Ask me the time of anything.
